  <item>
    <title>vol.32【清明节特辑】祖先业力不是伤害，而是已经不能服务于我们的旧时庇佑</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69d46e36e2c8be31558982b4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69d46e36e2c8be31558982b4</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 07 Apr 2026 02:43:35 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>身体积攒了一冬的废物，通过清明踏青来得到排出，这也是肝脏清理毒素的过程，但是你可曾想过，这些没用的废物，也曾是滋养我们身体的营养，只是现在被利用完了，就成了废物。</span></p><span></span><p><span>就如同祖先业力，并非是伤害，而是旧时祖先对我们的庇佑，只是现在不需要了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>既然如此，就让我们在这个时节，做一些清理吧，无论是身体层面，还是信念层面。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>-可选章节-</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 清明节气与肝气疏解</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="478">07:58</a> 身体清理冥想带领</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1302">21:42</a> 祖先业力</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2006">33:26</a> 业力燃烧冥想带领</span></h2><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><h2><span>- 本期主播 -</span></h2><span></span><p><span>文案｜吕宁</span></p><span></span><p><span>录音｜吕宁</span></p><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><h2><span>- 互动方式 -</span></h2><span></span><p><span>小宇宙：柒界冥想</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5a6d5b5c11be1013cb2dd660?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5a6d5b5c11be1013cb2dd660&amp;apptime=1706174704" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5a6d5b5c11be1013cb2dd660?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5a6d5b5c11be1013cb2dd660&amp;apptime=1706174704"><span>柒界疗愈</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>微信冥想群：ronei1314</span></p>]]></description>
