    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>开车会走神，想着下一阶段的工作计划；</span></p><span></span><p><span>陪家人心不在焉，想着之前所犯的错误；</span></p><span></span><p><span>睡前刷手机越看越清醒，最后记住的全是别人的生活…</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们总在错位活着，</span></p><span></span><p><span>身体在此时，心却卡在过去的遗憾、未来的担忧里打转。</span></p><span></span><p><span>心里堆满了来不及拆封的“此刻”，</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们总在追逐“更好”，却常常忘了“现在”才是最珍贵的，</span></p><span></span><p><span>这个冥想将会带你回到当下，不悔过去，不惧将来。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>- 本期主播 -</span></h2><span></span><p><span>文案｜吕宁</span></p><span></span><p><span>录音｜吕宁</span></p><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><h2><span>- 互动方式 -</span></h2><span></span><p><span>小宇宙：柒界冥想</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5a6d5b5c11be1013cb2dd660?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5a6d5b5c11be1013cb2dd660&amp;apptime=1706174704" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5a6d5b5c11be1013cb2dd660?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5a6d5b5c11be1013cb2dd660&amp;apptime=1706174704"><span>柒界疗愈</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>微信冥想群：ronei1314</span></p>]]></description>
