  <item>
    <title>vol.28【33个美德】「宽恕」并非是原谅，而是忆起曾经的约定</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/675eae3d84447b1bd003ab43</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">675eae3d84447b1bd003ab43</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 15 Dec 2024 10:25:28 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>宽恕并非是放弃对错是非，</span></p><span></span><p><span>而是自我解放，从受害者模式中将自己解救出来；</span></p><span></span><p><span>是不让自己受苦，从自我折磨的牢笼中解脱。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你正受困于宽恕的课题，想去成长，就需要一个人来协助你，</span></p><span></span><p><span>他要牺牲自己，去扮演一个伤害你的人，才能成就你。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是你们在另一个维度所约定好的，只是你忘记了。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>- 本期主播 -</span></h2><span></span><p><span>文案｜吕宁</span></p><span></span><p><span>录音｜吕宁</span></p><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><h2><span>- 互动方式 -</span></h2><span></span><p><span>小宇宙：柒界冥想</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5a6d5b5c11be1013cb2dd660?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5a6d5b5c11be1013cb2dd660&amp;apptime=1706174704" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5a6d5b5c11be1013cb2dd660?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5a6d5b5c11be1013cb2dd660&amp;apptime=1706174704"><span>柒界疗愈</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>微信冥想群：ronei1314</span></p>]]></description>
