    <guid isPermaLink="false">67287396cbe0e69c8bf851de</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 04 Nov 2024 07:19:04 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>人生的旅程中</span></p><span></span><p><span>总有无数的课题透过生活中的发生来到我们面前</span></p><span></span><p><span>有些事令人欣喜，有些事令人苦不堪言</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们将这些发生定义为“好事”和“坏事”</span></p><span></span><p><span>生命本无好坏之分，只是一场学习的过程</span></p><span></span><p><span>当你可以抽离出生命演绎的剧情时</span></p><span></span><p><span>所谓的好和坏都会转化成对你的滋养…</span></p><span></span><h2><span>- 本期主播 -</span></h2><span></span><p><span>文案｜吕宁</span></p><span></span><p><span>录音｜吕宁</span></p><span></span><h2><span>- 互动方式 -</span></h2><span></span><p><span>小宇宙：柒界冥想</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5a6d5b5c11be1013cb2dd660?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5a6d5b5c11be1013cb2dd660&amp;apptime=1706174704" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5a6d5b5c11be1013cb2dd660?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5a6d5b5c11be1013cb2dd660&amp;apptime=1706174704"><span>柒界疗愈</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>微信冥想群：ronei1314</span></p>]]></description>
