    <pubDate>Wed, 09 Oct 2024 11:28:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>宇宙中的一切都存在着不同的声音，万物皆天籁</span></p><span></span><p><span>但是当我们被担忧、焦虑等情绪缠缚时</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们的内心世界充满了嘈杂的噪音</span></p><span></span><p><span>自然也就无法聆听到周遭存在的声音之美</span></p><span></span><p><span>生命失去了聆听，一切的关系就失去了心的连接</span></p><span></span><p><span>让我们一起重拾这份心的聆听吧......</span></p><span></span><h2><span>- 本期主播 -</span></h2><span></span><p><span>文案｜吕宁</span></p><span></span><p><span>录音｜吕宁</span></p><span></span><h2><span>- 互动方式 -</span></h2><span></span><p><span>小宇宙：柒界冥想</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5a6d5b5c11be1013cb2dd660?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5a6d5b5c11be1013cb2dd660&amp;apptime=1706174704" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5a6d5b5c11be1013cb2dd660?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5a6d5b5c11be1013cb2dd660&amp;apptime=1706174704"><span>柒界疗愈</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>微信冥想群：ronei1314</span></p>]]></description>
